# BBQ Monitor — .gitignore

# Credentials — copy config.example.h to config.h and fill in your values.
# Matched in ANY directory (a stray config.h at the repo root was previously
# left exposed), plus local backup copies such as config.h.bak.
# config.example.h holds placeholders only and stays tracked.
config.h
config.h.*

# PlatformIO build artifacts — generated locally, not for version control
.pio/
